{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1259,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84eaecb36b043afd565c7673",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "结束后要去采购啊……\r\n今天那家超市很便宜──\r\n……啊～我在自言自语！",
      "source_fingerprint": "679647d5574dd95438fb04f5aa01d99c9f03a7957f0ad80d4e0db4a05c068edc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5215bf6573bef151d69fa971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唯独成长空间我敢自称\r\n天下第一啊！\r\n我会不断成长的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddbf16f9ad90c7633160cde027d8e87a0a930522809ebd9af589fbdbb34144cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe54582497ad4ae3218bae4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也想让哪个人看到\r\n你努力的样子吗？如果是的话，\r\n我可以帮你喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d49750c48e4e8405880d54e7d53459f5a02bc1ddcc8fff4f7fb23845950d49b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b5bce6c9f38eed45e91846b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既可以训练又能享受到旅行的感觉，\r\n实在是太一举两得了！\r\n哎呀～夏季集训最棒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "987bc6d28cd7b7ee13853c2a01fc9456c3e831933cc99f86637a220f9f7adfe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42724ba842174073c84c8610",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，走吧！\r\n充电完毕！电力满满！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfff2dbc33c678745192fdd2190345bbb514d07fdc5ea3ac975da6197554cf91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e3d0da906f49c6ac0de68a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "举头三尺有神明！\r\n不可以偷懒啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "248d1c62e5133469d9adbad5aafc1428459b2ef9d6f7fc40e1fb287174433758",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b63499660fdcf5835fb527a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经做好万全准备了！\r\n身心都像注连绳一样\r\n绷得紧紧的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5aaa1149ae91c9f1fd90d30da2128f192898b2a534c21a32b4824296217706e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3c2a08d0936ff1bfa664049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这身打扮让我心中的热情\r\n蠢蠢欲动，快要无法控制了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44e210f5aebd34822c1786d2b8f89a17f35d2db0ebca6d0f3a89356dc26d999e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2f4cb16a5ce249450eae5c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我背负的东西和别人可不一样。\r\n麻烦安排比平常更辛苦的训练啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c26d77dfbe04949593bb47ab5d209dcb6da2673974c7ece071161ce6a3a02a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42d39e87f3f99099e14a544b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感到干劲跟实力都不断提升！\r\n好想赶快跑得一鸣惊人\r\n想得不得了啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d4ab40cf19a20ebb396cdb4261a1e2f124b29048ba9123f7849462ec4f9eb87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e718b9ebda1acddfdb396bd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让你见识见识连神明看了\r\n都会腿软的特大「白色闪电」吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ac587c37d08ff155724790a8e6f5420dbbc5c0efa002b2c35ef6ef218b9d319",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aedfc293dd9eafe33d0a3c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～你还真是可靠的搭档啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1441ada33a7229123a391b853ad7a911737a980f466b1637ad0db48a1624041",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e5d7b5da2868c05404ce259",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「白色闪电」的名号已经威震天下了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0f11d182ecb13993b9862a3d58e2cbd802f6595eab01e8e4f8ab391ab323674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6437b8eb8d2bd785dc88d3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你跟我一起背负这份意志！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc2082a28ed78bd77baf699acd5a39f054ae73f862620990791331541aa11830",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:337979455320fd3d3710ef67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在历史上留名了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73da38591bbb69de8a1121928e757995f26bfc1f0c6e80225eb62f8baf5e1852",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0fb1f995c899b099c707fc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感觉到……自己长高了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dd7f10ed8649b1653d6229653637440148bb3e1049e6d75f81ad509683268e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02399e3092639181537ea5f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的实力才不只这样喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8627a2737ec535742dfca2ad9aed43f0cecf0360eedfbe48f62302b61a4808d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf87622e85983becf0e94026",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，我是玉藻十字！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b54cf7684fd7804a2b62009b879f1634f41ae90109b8eb823816a148e3272dbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15a3d046150093e8613ef92f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风驰电掣的「白色闪电」！\r\n火光四射地参战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c4b1829f1798deb95853b302b8a45e9385e08cd8a4fea03cc65176036965f07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a73b8377cd96b1295afd77f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，由我来照顾你吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc8414cd865a21ea03753d33ab8384be8b5ccc23ad5961e657327f4d947cea28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26c1c91bf55a7759e13fa437",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放～心交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "541ab4216c2fe65994369cd4cb469b3a3226ccc2f2a963e3fc85e9afdb00bbcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5494e498186680a10662ad78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感到令人浑身发麻的强劲力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be324454c0101dc2825497b39565c04b840c4cd1d3654300ccbf3c1d89c8506e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d4fd5a1ebeff6976b7b2985",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "期待是用来超越的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26c9845a5bcfe4ead9f29ed8aa99826b8d81fe2181393f7fc6b371e4dcc007a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2442c3b2a6b41f587473312",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要用轰天巨雷，\r\n在历史上留下痕迹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f61e3629e1e909441cdd818a0075cb1c3f3c207fb9205cff43f0b17a1b19e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac335d45a61b30fd9332abf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是玉藻十字！好了，走吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbac5b1e9bc5cfaaca675c9fc258ca9925218a100532804960d4fdf0b35eaf1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0da1a40e377ac10513273424",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出战吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45e81659c7d8cb25d832a62bba04333afacea8e9fea56c476c86cbc10fe31713",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf6d0aeae0321561b5f9a873",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能让我自由地奔跑，\n你也需要做好各种各样的觉悟呢…\n不过看起来,已经下定决心了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9811cf103d3a2ea7e8b3c3e16f40cd70fa23e7d1592dff805feb8d0ed7374453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea39b0ce3e6d6b72aff4bf03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b0ea50770e74cc57d8f86c94661e324efb2d5121688e3ebb0854357aea8420",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7c744e61492f17838b06740",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdc5376bfb1153fa0e2c9119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有你在，\n就有种不管哪里都能去到的感觉呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d1edb1d344710d7381287e72edf78c680ae1ba2dcca0a65a39b57978dcfc696",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07d260fb5a9d6d58fd16c09a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是特别的日子还是平常的日子，\n你都陪在我身边\n所以每一天对我都是重要的回忆哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "09bd2c4555d22e3969e1e1eb53d704d04c8af2cdf94d0826c28438a0cc0b402b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1a6331edff7e404c9773ff7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\n今年也祝愿您万事吉祥……\n什么的～今年也请您多加关照♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd49f2341eb9babca44aa85a5d1e60c2022ffe24fce9cfded016103418ff568f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e61d6623d4e452e29588e9f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年准备了我们主厨做的特别巧克力！\n绝～对很美味，\n一定要尝尝看噢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "959e9d666ecee0920d7ab2b558a829a445fd2cb82af7a76b01b89fb3c0c7db38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f099bda6c7a302704ae2892",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我待会把巧克力和贺卡给你哦。\n不过……上面写的东西，\n就当是我们两个人的秘密吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8071698cf9a64eb9a1627b28ca4d58e78c93adf730e5472cb83a592731329ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5669389979c29f26ca076350",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也用竹子上挂了诗笺哦♪\n在日本学会的折纸，\n真想让城堡里的大家也看看呀～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00a3d45e0da0d2b3f7a2bf01717cc13f9f8f1f4389200d13a597647fe5ca4407",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e1f874589c5e8c0664c27ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说万圣节起源于古代凯尔特呢。\n说起来，我家的宝物库里，\n好像也有变装用的衣物哦～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "427f012ac559c4e6756e5683ede219226ec4a398ce1a4869bf0cd44c1ab8ee8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7efae9e751c626ebd609a91a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天宿舍的大家会交换圣诞节礼物呢！\n真有学生的感觉呢♪\n我的礼物会送到谁手上呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "413a34583e7d8972a9bb3927013f989c3b583d4af53d6f2631aefbfb2986227c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:857753aa28105ffa29f9d536",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你今晚有空吗？\n我想去看看街上的灯彩，\n能请您带我一起去吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "291d35af98d439872520b1f44074f9b9a90f31791167929850423c041aaf237c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e38e72fd13f4e470b84ad6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dc4a4a75c655e69f5aa9602de71b3b3b441439d2887a36bbc821e42c3c4f4c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d365251d62b5bcae0917837",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "除夕夜的时候，\n要把榭寄生的叶子放在枕头下面呢。\n训练员，我分你一片叶子哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7b6d0f8c740d356f4d4e8fc3c950237b34d207e982c3af90cf1d7696bdfe725",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a55f24530c49a0f0cb73b514",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐哦♪\n虽然只是微不足道的祝福…\n不过，还请尽情期待礼物哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed2d3a60ae8fafe312a835aad17143c8f1970c1c073b5463d03ef9668dfd193b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3204b1e7023570b4295b1d3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看见请柬了吗？\n是我为你举办的生日派对哦～\n今天就由我来”护送“你吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e71b09073108c64f18ea83a2c40a2a8be1cb36cd39b114925ec7ba30b15d77d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30b6f4bdd3d26396300ef122",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍里寄来了各国的生日礼物，\n实在是太多了……\n同学们都惊呼着『发生了什么！』了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65312b5565a4c7b18b2d0023727a471a92c815a1b7b900701e886777f4096cff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92c5b1db0145c07e42347540",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天想和你一起拍张照呢♪\n第一次在异国他乡过生日的模样，\n想让城堡的大家也看看呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f644f41aa2d53f4578d5858c53de1eb85eb5ee723e2bcb5383afaddc828cab4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:601b4f240f3cd0bb0cf48b32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，好像有什么新通知呢！\n可别忘记去看看哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a14d8a603eba445e28c443114af36d1ddcd5bf2e75656bb5d4db6bfcca2a535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08f1365049743b6c81b88394",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有什么礼物送到了呢♪\n会是什么呢？好期待～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f10ba2068d2c233b1368682a6f3d1d05c08935b422db75539f69ee0ff7720da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c7a3923e91e55d903542e64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功完成任务了呢！\n赐你些奖励吧～♪…开玩笑的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1ab8629737c40b31be06035b6ec34023700f6dd8399e50941d4e5a5e04592be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba5d8bbca08da612880b9028",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像要开始了呢♪\n大家都玩得很开心的样子，\n我也得提前安排下时间呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9711a30d516ef9ae97f9cffcf07be817dea76dd09c3a56f40e736444bf72416f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ef5c987b82206e6c2e8aac4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像正在进行中～♪\n尽情玩乐之后，\n就要安排慰劳的茶话会了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5e670c569ff9e9c937cfffe9fee1a498adc8b1adbf0272086599d00682671b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:119fa5a023778df4d1c560c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……下次一定……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e4ce700934a9c8bc57ee134bf2f5501aef38bf50990d8f64a776c16bcc56349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed5f8394cfaa21624b650da2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊，赛马娘名鉴的等级，\n好像上升了哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d527fe256912a83cf44c4fba3cf7225a96ff373c03b0e2e6bf7d965c009799a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54fe521ffa8a83a55a860604",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どのような場に招かれても、\r\nすぐ行ける格好でいたいの！\r\nパーティー、森…どこへでも♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5605be129dbf3514e84b6e52d1c6f175ae92e843261eac15237944f4d556f0a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13656fcc5115cc239e89b90c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "初めてラーメンを食べた日、\r\nシャツに汁を飛ばしちゃって…\r\n染み抜きというものを覚えました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "002f2de01f39486847af069ce8fe7990756fbc065cfd72de88800eb2459c516a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:681d5e0611785ad50dcaf072",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "歴史のあるお洋服って素敵。\r\nこのスカートもおばあさまから\r\n受け継いで、大切に着ているの！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6f58ae6b1a83febc89d05b7bc6d7e5170bf547a17f369ac47784220dcd95e39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
